==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)|Kabuto Cat]], [[Kuwagata Cat (Special Cat)|Kuwagata Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N202 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N202]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*6 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Kuwagata Cat (Special Cat)|Kuwagata Cat]] and [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)|Kabuto Cat]] to win. They do need to be lv.30, or close, to be able to deal enough damage to knock back Elizabeth before the winds push your units to your base. It is recommended to get at least Chapter 1 of the [[Into the Future]]'s anti-Alien crystals, however, the more the better.

